  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq1500.html",
  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1503.24 Permit Amendments",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1503.24 Permit Amendments.\n\n(a) Permit holders may request to amend a permit to:\n\n(1) Modify the approved project;\n\n(2) Transfer the permit to another permit holder; and\n\n(3) Extend the permit duration.\n\n(b) To apply for an amended permit, the person requesting the amendment shall complete an “Alteration of Terrain Amendment Request Form”, NHDES-W-01-001, dated August 2026, and submit it through NHEnviro, in addition to any information required per Env-Wq 1503.25, Env-Wq 1503.26, or Env-Wq 1503.27.\n\n(c) Upon receipt of an application to amend a permit, the department shall send notice through NHEnviro to the affected municipalities in accordance with RSA 541-A:39 that includes a link to the application.\n\n(d) If the request to amend the permit is approved, the department shall amend the permit as requested and send notice through NHEnviro that includes a link to the amended permit to the permit holder and to the affected municipalities.\n\n(e) The amendment of a permit shall not subject any provision of the original permit that was not amended to a new appeal period.\n\nSource. #14472, eff 1-19-26, EXPIRES: 1-19-36; ss by #14656, eff 8-6-26, EXPIRES: 8-6-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq1500.html"
